### Describe the bug

There's a extra mapping (1, 0 => 0, 0) noticed after swc v1.2.150, in included helpers such as `_classCallCheck`.

### Input code

```typescript
class Shape {
	constructor (id, x, y) {
		this.id = id
	}
}
var s = new Shape("Shape ID", 1,2);
s;
```


### Config

```json
{
  "jsc": {
    "target": "es5",
    "parser": {
      "syntax": "ecmascript"
    }
  },
  "module": {
    "type": "commonjs"
  },
  "sourceMaps": true,
  "isModule": false
}
```


### Playground link

https://play.swc.rs/?version=1.2.150&code=H4sIAAAAAAAAA0vOSSwuVgjOSCxIVajm4kzOzysuKSpNLskvUtDITNFRqNBRqNQEyXCWZGQW62WmKNgqZKZwcdZy1XKVJRYpFAP5eanlEBM0lCAGeboo6SgY6hhpWnMVWwMAC44IVmIAAAA%3D&config=H4sIAAAAAAAAAy3LMQ6DMBBE0btM7TaN78AhVpsNAmFs7awlEPLdA1GqXzz9CysV%2BUKIzxbIML6Q0MRp%2FgDPPeR4QItQfWmBMRJKfffNfuvZ7kJrKXVfiRtZu6tN0ogc3i1h4fQfPrLRxhe4j3L6eQAAAA%3D%3D

### Expected behavior

There shouldn't be redundant/invalid sourcemaps at the start (eg: `_classCallCheck`):
<img width="1209" alt="before 1 2 150" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/35959/164250618-ac4ea9e4-8b1d-4fab-9ed5-41aad4378e2e.png">



### Actual behavior

Redundant sourcemap at `_classCallCheck` start
<img width="1219" alt="after 1 2 150" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/35959/164250658-f5b67c59-911b-44c5-ad5c-b30247cd7541.png">


### Version

1.2.160

